Description: Omaxian desktop session (Omarchy for X11: i3 + Quickshell)
 Vendored Omaxian (port of Omarchy to Devuan/X11/i3) with its pinned Omarchy
 upstream, so no network access is needed at install time.
 .
 Provides the "Omaxian" X session (default on Omaxian OS), a pre-rendered home
 template that is seeded into /etc/skel and into any home that lacks it at
 first login, the root-owned omarchy-dns helper and a sysvinit script for
 power-profiles-daemon.
